  "description": "Vali-Tempo is the all-in-one meta-package for the Vali-Tempo ecosystem. Installing it gives you every module — Vali-Time, Vali-Range, Vali-Calendar, Vali-CountDown, Vali-Age, Vali-Holiday, Vali-TimeZone, Vali-Schedule, Vali-Duration, Vali-BusinessHours, and Vali-Bucket — with a single NuGet reference and a single DI registration call.",
